@Gymnasio_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Socios
GET {{Gymnasio_HostAddress}}/api/socios
Accept: application/json

### Buscar socios
GET {{Gymnasio_HostAddress}}/api/socios?buscar=Diego
Accept: application/json

### Membresias
GET {{Gymnasio_HostAddress}}/api/membresias
Accept: application/json

### Filtro por plan
GET {{Gymnasio_HostAddress}}/api/membresias?plan=Mensual
Accept: application/json

### Membresias de un socio
GET {{Gymnasio_HostAddress}}/api/socios/1/membresias
Accept: application/json

### Socio inexistente
GET {{Gymnasio_HostAddress}}/api/socios/2147483647
Accept: application/json
